    {
      "type": "thinking",
      "thinking": "I'm sketching the data model for people and expenses, planning to validate names for uniqueness and parse amounts carefully into integer cents to avoid floating-point errors.\n\nFor splitting, I'll divide the total evenly among selected people with any remainder cents distributed to the first few in order, then compute each person's balance as what they paid minus their share. For settling up, I'll use a greedy algorithm matching creditors and debtors to minimize the number of transfers, since balances always sum to zero.\n\nI'm planning localStorage persistence under a versioned key, and deciding to skip person removal/renaming to avoid complicating existing expenses. I want error messages to appear inline near each form, preserving user input on failure rather than resetting fields, and keeping payer/split controls in sync when people are added without losing existing checkbox state.\n\nI'm settling on a warm \"Even Keel\" visual theme with navy, signal red, and teal accent colors, checking contrast ratios for accessibility, and pairing a serif display font with a clean sans body font via Google Fonts.\n\nNow I'm working out the HTML structure: a main wrapper containing a header, then card sections for people, add-expense form, expense list, balances, and settle-up, arranged in a responsive grid that stacks on mobile and splits into columns on larger screens.\n\n",
      "signature": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en-CA\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Even Keel</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500..700&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400..600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root{\n  --harbour:#1F3A4D;\n  --harbour-soft:#E4EBEF;\n  --signal:#C2462B;\n  --signal-dark:#A63A22;\n  --paper:#F5F1EA;\n  --card:#FFFDF9;\n  --ink:#1B2A35;\n  --muted:#55616B;\n  --line:#DDD6CA;\n  --field-border:#7D8790;\n  --tide:#2E6B5E;\n  --danger-bg:#FBEAE5;\n  --serif:\"Fraunces\", Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n  --sans:\"Instrument Sans\", system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0}\nbody{\n  background:var(--paper);\n  color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:var(--sans);\n  font-size:16px;\n  line-height:1.5;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n}\nmain{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px 56px}\nh1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;margin:0;line-height:1.2;color:var(--harbour)}\nh2{font-size:1.4rem}\np{margin:0}\n:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--harbour);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:4px}\n\n/* Masthead */\n.masthead{border-bottom:2px solid var(--harbour);padding:4px 0 18px;margin-bottom:24px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px 20px}\n.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\n.mark{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--harbour);position:relative;flex:none}\n.mark::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:8px;right:8px;top:50%;height:4px;margin-top:-2px;background:var(--signal);border-radius:2px}\nh1{font-size:2rem;letter-spacing:-0.01em}\n.tagline{color:var(--muted);font-size:0.98rem}\n\n/* Layout */\n.layout{display:grid;gap:20px;grid-template-columns:1fr}\n.col{display:grid;gap:20px;align-content:start;min-width:0}\n@media (min-width:860px){\n  .layout{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,5fr) minmax(0,6fr);align-items:start}\n}\n\n/* Cards */\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;min-width:0}\n.card-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin-bottom:14px}\n.hint{color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem}\n\n/* Forms */\nlabel,legend{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:0.92rem;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--ink)}\n.field{margin-bottom:14px;min-width:0}\ninput[type=text],input[type=number],input:not([type]),select{\n  width:100%;\n  min-width:0;\n  font:inherit;\n  font-size:16px;\n  color:var(--ink);\n  background:#fff;\n  border:1.5px solid var(--field-border);\n  border-radius:9px;\n  padding:10px 12px;\n  min-height:44px;\n}\ninput:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline-offset:0;border-color:var(--harbour);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(31,58,77,.25)}\ninput[aria-invalid=true]{border-color:var(--signal-dark);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(194,70,43,.2)}\nselect:disabled{background:#EEE;color:var(--muted)}\n.row{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.row > input{flex:1 1 180px}\n.btn{\n  font:inherit;font-weight:600;\n  min-height:44px;\n  padding:10px 18px;\n  border-radius:9px;\n  border:1.5px solid transparent;\n  background:var(--signal);\n  color:#fff;\n  cursor:pointer;\n  white-space:nowrap;\n}\n.btn:hover{background:var(--signal-dark)}\n.btn:focus-visible{outline-color:var(--harbour)}\n.btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--signal-dark);border-color:var(--signal-dark);padding:6px 12px;min-height:36px;font-size:0.9rem}\n.btn.ghost:hover{background:var(--danger-bg)}\n.btn.full{width:100%;margin-top:4px}\nfieldset{border:0;padding:0;margin:0 0 14px;min-width:0}\n.checks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n.check{\n  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\n  min-height:44px;padding:8px 12px;\n  border:1.5px solid var(--field-border);border-radius:9px;\n  background:#fff;cursor:pointer;margin:0;font-weight:500;\n  max-width:100%;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\n}\n.check input{width:18px;height:18px;margin:0;accent-color:var(--harbour);flex:none}\n.check:has(input:checked){background:var(--harbour-soft);border-color:var(--harbour)}\n.check:focus-within{outline:3px solid var(--harbour);outline-offset:2px}\n\n.error{\n  background:var(--danger-bg);\n  color:var(--signal-dark);\n  border-left:4px solid var(--signal-dark);\n  padding:8px 12px;\n  border-radius:6px;\n  font-size:0.92rem;\n  font-weight:600;\n  margin:10px 0 0;\n}\n.error:empty{display:none}\n\n/* Lists */\n.list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n.item{\n  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;\n  padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);min-width:0;\n}\n.item:first-child{border-top:0}\n.item-main{min-width:0;flex:1}\n.item-title{font-weight:600;overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n.item-meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n.amount{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;text-align:right}\n.empty{\n  color:var(--muted);\n  border:1.5px dashed var(--line);\n  border-radius:10px;\n  padding:18px;\n  text-align:center;\n  font-size:0.95rem;\n}\n\n/* Balances */\n.bal .amount{font-size:1.05rem}\n.bal .status{display:block;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;text-align:right}\n.pos .amount,.pos .status{color:var(--tide)}\n.neg .amount,.neg .status{color:var(--signal-dark)}\n.zero .amount,.zero .status{color:var(--muted)}\n\n.transfer{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.transfer:first-child{border-top:0}\n.transfer .who{flex:1 1 200px;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n.transfer .arrow{color:var(--signal);font-weight:600}\n.transfer .amount{font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--harbour)}\n\n.summary-note{font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}\n.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main data-testid=\"app\">\n  <header class=\"masthead\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <span class=\"mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <h1>Even Keel</h1>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">Log what you paid. See who owes whom. Get back to even.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"layout\">\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"people-h\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\">\n          <h2 id=\"people-h\">People</h2>\n          <span class=\"hint\" id=\"people-count\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <form id=\"person-form\" novalidate>\n          <div class=\"field\">\n            <label for=\"person-name\">Name</label>\n            <div class=\"row\">\n              <input id=\"person-name\" data-testid=\"person-name\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" maxlength=\"40\" aria-describedby=\"person-hint\">\n              <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn\" data-testid=\"add-person\">Add person</button>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"hint\" id=\"person-hint\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Names must be unique, ignoring capitals.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"person-error\"></div>\n        </form>\n        <ul class=\"list\" id=\"people\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"></ul>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"expense-h\">\n        <h2 id=\"expense-h\" style=\"margin-bottom:14px\">Log an expense</h2>\n        <form id=\"expense-form\" novalidate>\n          <div class=\"field\">\n            <label for=\"expense-desc\">Description</label>\n            <input id=\"expense-desc\" data-testid=\"expense-desc\" type=\"text\" maxlength=\"80\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"Groceries, ferry, dinner\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"field\">\n            <label for=\"expense-amount\">Amount (CAD)</label>\n            <input id=\"expense-amount\" data-testid=\"expense-amount\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"0.00\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"field\">\n            <label for=\"expense-payer\">Paid by</label>\n            <select id=\"expense-payer\" data-testid=\"expense-payer\"></select>\n          </div>\n          <fieldset>\n            <legend>Split between</legend>\n            <div class=\"checks\" data-testid=\"expense-split\" id=\"expense-split\"></div>\n          </fieldset>\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn full\" data-testid=\"add-expense\">Add expense</button>\n          <div id=\"expense-error\"></div>\n        </form>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"balance-h\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\">\n          <h2 id=\"balance-h\">Balances</h2>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"list\" id=\"balances\"></ul>\n        <p class=\"summary-note\">Positive means you are owed money. Negative means you owe.</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"settle-h\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\">\n          <h2 id=\"settle-h\">Settle up</h2>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"list\" id=\"transfers\"></ul>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"expenses-h\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\">\n          <h2 id=\"expenses-h\">Expenses</h2>\n          <span class=\"hint\" id=\"expense-count\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"list\" id=\"expenses\"></ul>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  \"use strict\";\n  var KEY = \"even-keel:v1\";\n  var money = new Intl.NumberFormat(\"en-CA\", { style: \"currency\", currency: \"CAD\" });\n\n  var state = load();\n  var errors = { person: \"\", expense: \"\" };\n  var renderedNames = [];\n\n  var $ = function (id) { return document.getElementById(id); };\n  var personForm = $(\"person-form\"), personName = $(\"person-name\");\n  var expenseForm = $(\"expense-form\"), expDesc = $(\"expense-desc\"), expAmount = $(\"expense-amount\");\n  var payerSel = $(\"expense-payer\"), splitBox = $(\"expense-split\");\n\n  function load() {\n    try {\n      var d = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));\n      if (d && Array.isArray(d.people) && Array.isArray(d.expenses)) return d;\n    } catch (e) { /* ignore corrupt storage */ }\n    return { people: [], expenses: [] };\n  }\n  function save() {\n    try { localStorage.setItem(KEY, JSON.stringify(state)); } catch (e) { /* storage full or blocked */ }\n  }\n  function esc(s) {\n    return String(s).replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\").replace(/</g, \"&lt;\").replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n      .replace(/\"/g, \"&quot;\").replace(/'/g, \"&#39;\");\n  }\n  function fmt(cents) { return money.format(cents / 100); }\n\n  // Split integer cents across n people; leftover cents go to the first ones.\n  function splitCents(cents, n) {\n    var base = Math.floor(cents / n), rem = cents - base * n, out = [];\n    for (var i = 0; i < n; i++) out.push(base + (i < rem ? 1 : 0));\n    return out;\n  }\n\n  // Parses \"12\", \"12.5\", \"12.50\" into integer cents. Returns null if invalid or not > 0.\n  function parseAmount(s) {\n    var t = s.trim();\n    if (!/^(?:\\d+(?:\\.\\d{1,2})?|\\.\\d{1,2})$/.test(t)) return null;\n    var parts = t.split(\".\"), whole = parseInt(parts[0] || \"0\", 10);\n    var frac = parseInt(((parts[1] || \"\") + \"00\").slice(0, 2), 10);\n    var cents = whole * 100 + frac;\n    return cents > 0 ? cents : null;\n  }\n\n  function computeBalances() {\n    var bal = new Map();\n    state.people.forEach(function (p) { bal.set(p, 0); });\n    state.expenses.forEach(function (e) {\n      bal.set(e.payer, (bal.get(e.payer) || 0) + e.cents);\n      var sel = state.people.filter(function (p) { return e.split.indexOf(p) !== -1; });\n      var shares = splitCents(e.cents, sel.length);\n      sel.forEach(function (p, i) { bal.set(p, bal.get(p) - shares[i]); });\n    });\n    return bal;\n  }\n\n  function computeTransfers(bal) {\n    var cred = [], debt = [], out = [];\n    bal.forEach(function (c, name) {\n      if (c > 0) cred.push({ name: name, c: c });\n      else if (c < 0) debt.push({ name: name, c: -c });\n    });\n    cred.sort(function (a, b) { return b.c - a.c; });\n    debt.sort(function (a, b) { return b.c - a.c; });\n    var i = 0, j = 0;\n    while (i < cred.length && j < debt.length) {\n      var amt = Math.min(cred[i].c, debt[j].c);\n      out.push({ from: debt[j].name, to: cred[i].name, cents: amt });\n      cred[i].c -= amt; debt[j].c -= amt;\n      if (cred[i].c === 0) i++;\n      if (debt[j].c === 0) j++;\n    }\n    return out;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Rendering ---------- */\n\n  function renderPeopleControls() {\n    var prevChecked = {};\n    Array.prototype.forEach.call(splitBox.querySelectorAll(\"input\"), function (cb) {\n      prevChecked[cb.value] = cb.checked;\n    });\n    var prevPayer = payerSel.value;\n\n    splitBox.innerHTML = \"\";\n    payerSel.innerHTML = \"\";\n    if (state.people.length === 0) {\n      var o = document.createElement(\"option\");\n      o.value = \"\"; o.textContent = \"Add people first\";\n      payerSel.appendChild(o);\n    }\n    state.people.forEach(function (name, i) {\n      var opt = document.createElement(\"option\");\n      opt.value = name; opt.textContent = name;\n      payerSel.appendChild(opt);\n\n      var label = document.createElement(\"label\");\n      label.className = \"check\";\n      var cb = document.createElement(\"input\");\n      cb.type = \"checkbox\";\n      cb.value = name;\n      cb.id = \"split-\" + i;\n      cb.checked = renderedNames.indexOf(name) === -1 ? true : !!prevChecked[name];\n      label.appendChild(cb);\n      label.appendChild(document.createTextNode(\" \" + name));\n      splitBox.appendChild(label);\n    });\n    if (state.people.indexOf(prevPayer) !== -1) payerSel.value = prevPayer;\n    renderedNames = state.people.slice();\n  }\n\n  function renderPeople() {\n    var n = state.people.length;\n    $(\"people-count\").textContent = n ? n + (n === 1 ? \" person\" : \" people\") : \"\";\n    var ul = $(\"people\");\n    if (!n) {\n      ul.innerHTML = '<li class=\"empty\">No one yet. Add everyone coming on the trip, including yourself.</li>';\n      return;\n    }\n    ul.innerHTML = state.people.map(function (p) {\n      return '<li class=\"item\" data-testid=\"person\"><span class=\"item-title\">' + esc(p) + \"</span></li>\";\n    }).join(\"\");\n  }\n\n  function renderExpenses() {\n    var n = state.expenses.length;\n    $(\"expense-count\").textContent = n ? n + (n === 1 ? \" expense\" : \" expenses\") : \"\";\n    var ul = $(\"expenses\");\n    if (!n) {\n      ul.innerHTML = '<li class=\"empty\">No expenses yet. Log what someone paid and each share is worked out for you.</li>';\n      return;\n    }\n    ul.innerHTML = state.expenses.map(function (e) {\n      return '<li class=\"item\" data-testid=\"expense\">' +\n        '<div class=\"item-main\">' +\n          '<div class=\"item-title\">' + esc(e.desc) + \"</div>\" +\n          '<div class=\"item-meta\">Paid by ' + esc(e.payer) + \" · split \" + e.split.length +\n          (e.split.length === 1 ? \" way\" : \" ways\") + \": \" + esc(e.split.join(\", \")) + \"</div>\" +\n        \"</div>\" +\n        '<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:6px\">' +\n          '<span class=\"amount\">' + fmt(e.cents) + \"</span>\" +\n          '<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn ghost\" data-testid=\"delete-expense\" data-id=\"' + esc(e.id) +\n          '\" aria-label=\"Remove expense: ' + esc(e.desc) + '\">Remove</button>' +\n        \"</div>\" +\n      \"</li>\";\n    }).join(\"\");\n  }\n\n  function renderBalances() {\n    var ul = $(\"balances\");\n    if (!state.people.length) {\n      ul.innerHTML = '<li class=\"empty\">Add people to see who is owed and who owes.</li>';\n      return;\n    }\n    var bal = computeBalances();\n    ul.innerHTML = state.people.map(function (p) {\n      var c = bal.get(p), cls, status;\n      if (c > 0) { cls = \"pos\"; status = \"is owed\"; }\n      else if (c < 0) { cls = \"neg\"; status = \"owes\"; }\n      else { cls = \"zero\"; status = \"even\"; }\n      var shown = c < 0 ? fmt(-c) : fmt(c);\n      var sign = c < 0 ? \"−\" : \"\";\n      return '<li class=\"item bal ' + cls + '\" data-testid=\"balance\" data-person=\"' + esc(p) +\n        '\" data-cents=\"' + c + '\">' +\n        '<span class=\"item-title\">' + esc(p) + \"</span>\" +\n        '<span><span class=\"amount\">' + sign + shown + '</span><span class=\"status\">' + status + \"</span></span>\" +\n      \"</li>\";\n    }).join(\"\");\n  }\n\n  function renderTransfers() {\n    var ul = $(\"transfers\");\n    if (!state.people.length) {\n      ul.innerHTML = '<li class=\"empty\">Nothing to settle yet.</li>';\n      return;\n    }\n    var transfers = computeTransfers(computeBalances());\n    if (!transfers.length) {\n      ul.innerHTML = '<li class=\"empty\">Everyone is even. Nothing to settle.</li>';\n      return;\n    }\n    ul.innerHTML = transfers.map(function (t) {\n      return '<li class=\"transfer\" data-testid=\"transfer\" data-from=\"' + esc(t.from) + '\" data-to=\"' +\n        esc(t.to) + '\" data-cents=\"' + t.cents + '\">' +\n        '<span class=\"who\"><strong>' + esc(t.from) + \"</strong> pays <strong>\" + esc(t.to) + \"</strong></span>\" +\n        '<span class=\"amount\">' + fmt(t.cents) + \"</span>\" +\n      \"</li>\";\n    }).join(\"\");\n  }\n\n  function renderErrors() {\n    $(\"person-error\").innerHTML = errors.person\n      ? '<p class=\"error\" role=\"alert\" data-testid=\"form-error\">' + esc(errors.person) + \"</p>\" : \"\";\n    $(\"expense-error\").innerHTML = errors.expense\n      ? '<p class=\"error\" role=\"alert\" data-testid=\"form-error\">' + esc(errors.expense) + \"</p>\" : \"\";\n    personName.setAttribute(\"aria-invalid\", errors.person ? \"true\" : \"false\");\n    expDesc.setAttribute(\"aria-invalid\", errors.expense && !expDesc.value.trim() ? \"true\" : \"false\");\n  }\n\n  function renderAll() {\n    renderPeopleControls();\n    renderPeople();\n    renderExpenses();\n    renderBalances();\n    renderTransfers();\n    renderErrors();\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Actions ---------- */\n\n  personForm.addEventListener(\"submit\", function (e) {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    var raw = personName.value.trim();\n    var err = \"\";\n    if (!raw) err = \"Enter a name to add someone.\";\n    else if (state.people.some(function (p) { return p.toLowerCase() === raw.toLowerCase(); }))\n      err = \"\\u201C\" + raw + \"\\u201D is already on the trip.\";\n    errors.person = err;\n    if (err) { renderErrors(); personName.focus(); return; }\n    state.people.push(raw);\n    save();\n    personName.value = \"\";\n    errors.person = \"\";\n    renderAll();\n    personName.focus();\n  });\n\n  expenseForm.addEventListener(\"submit\", function (e) {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    var desc = expDesc.value.trim();\n    var cents = parseAmount(expAmount.value);\n    var payer = payerSel.value;\n    var picked = Array.prototype.filter.call(splitBox.querySelectorAll(\"input:checked\"), function () { return true; })\n      .map(function (cb) { return cb.value; });\n    var split = state.people.filter(function (p) { return picked.indexOf(p) !== -1; });\n    var err = \"\";\n    if (!desc) err = \"Add a description, such as \\u201CGroceries\\u201D.\";\n    else if (cents === null) err = \"Enter an amount greater than zero, with at most 2 decimal places (for example 42.50).\";\n    else if (!payer || state.people.indexOf(payer) === -1) err = \"Add people to the trip before logging an expense.\";\n    else if (!split.length) err = \"Choose at least one person to split this between.\";\n    errors.expense = err;\n    if (err) { renderErrors(); (desc ? (cents === null ? expAmount : payerSel) : expDesc).focus(); return; }\n\n    state.expenses.unshift({\n      id: Date.now().toString(36) + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 7),\n      desc: desc, cents: cents, payer: payer, split: split\n    });\n    save();\n    expDesc.value = \"\";\n    expAmount.value = \"\";\n    Array.prototype.forEach.call(splitBox.querySelectorAll(\"input\"), function (cb) { cb.checked = true; });\n    errors.expense = \"\";\n    renderAll();\n    expDesc.focus();\n  });\n\n  expDesc.addEventListener(\"input\", function () {\n    if (errors.expense) { errors.expense = \"\"; renderErrors(); }\n  });\n  expAmount.addEventListener(\"input\", function () {\n    if (errors.expense) { errors.expense = \"\"; renderErrors(); }\n  });\n\n  $(\"expenses\").addEventListener(\"click\", function (e) {\n    var btn = e.target.closest('[data-testid=\"delete-expense\"]');\n    if (!btn) return;\n    var id = btn.getAttribute(\"data-id\");\n    state.expenses = state.expenses.filter(function (x) { return x.id !== id; });\n    save();\n    renderAll();\n    var first = $(\"expenses\").querySelector('[data-testid=\"delete-expense\"]');\n    (first || expDesc).focus();\n  });\n\n  renderAll();\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"
    }
